  "whyAValueReachesDrawnTextWithNothingReadingIt": {
    "server/lib/message-keys.ts": "The kind is message or report, because theRecordsAWriteNames returns before this line for every other kind, and both words read the same as their stored form. It is printed in the English line of the answer to a stored write, read by the program that wrote it, saying that the records its words name could not be read.",
    "shared/round-chapters/delivery.ts": "The round kind is a caller-declared policy key, printed exactly when a policy mapping is invalid. This is a configuration diagnostic, not a stored record kind or state being used as a page label.",
    "shared/round-chapters/manifest.ts": "The round kind is the caller-declared policy key in the saved reading manifest. The launcher and check print its exact value so the selected policy can be reviewed; it is not a record-kind or state label.",
    "shared/round-start-pack.ts": "The round-start pack is text for the agent that takes the round, and no page draws it. A delegation's parent kind (decision or task), a material's kind (decision, point, bundle or task) and the taker's kind (person or agent) are the delegation package's own stored words. The agent names them back to the delegation doors, so the stored word is the one it needs.",
    "server/lib/sealed-tip.ts": "cutFromCommit is the exact session field a caller must correct when its recorded value is malformed.",
    "server/db/schema-parts/agent-starter-changes.ts": "The state column is put into the SQL of the table's own check constraints and one partial index, which SQLite reads and no person does. Nothing here is drawn or sent in a reply.",
    "web/lib/add-to-a-note.ts": "The field is the name of the field a record keeps its blocks in, put into a regular expression that finds a block by its path. Nothing draws the expression or the text it is matched against.",
    "web/api-parts/records.ts": "The kind is a record kind the page names in its links read, put with a link type into the typeToKind word of the GET /api/links query. The door reads the word, and nothing draws the query.",
    "web/components/RevokeTheirKey.tsx": "The kind is a participant's kind, agent or person, put with its id into the row word of the GET /api/office/embassy query, which asks for the one row whose keys the panel draws. The door reads the word, and nothing draws it."
  }
}
